{"id":"zh-Hans-198","text":"一会儿少放一点儿盐。","categories":["casual-speech","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hans-199","text":"退税少了18元，我去问问。","categories":["numbers-counters","casual-speech"]}
{"id":"zh-Hans-200","text":"这间房每晚三百五十元。","categories":["numbers-counters","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hans-201","text":"别急着走，饺子还没煮好。","categories":["casual-speech","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hans-202","text":"何秋白编辑把稿子退回来了。","categories":["names","suffix-chains"]}
